WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.350
Imagine a prince waking
up in a cobbler's body,

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.950
still holding all his own memories.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.830
So what makes you, you?

4
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.100
Your body, your memories, or a soul?

5
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.320
For many believers, life after death only
counts if the one who lives on is really

6
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.180
you.

7
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.170
So if God made a perfect
copy of you after you died,

8
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.680
would that copy really be you?

9
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:28.700
In this mission, you'll compare an
immortal soul with the resurrection of the

10
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.700
body.

11
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:34.480
Then you'll follow John Hick's strange
story of a man who vanishes in the USA,

12
00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.770
and appears in India.

13
00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:40.090
Your mission: weigh up
whether a perfect copy of you,

14
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:43.550
made by God after death,
would really be you.
